{"id":"b4a7907a385b0f04","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-rel-comprandom.md","title":"相对可计算随机性","display":"df-rel-comprandom — 相对可计算随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-rel-comprandom","aliases":["43-df-rel-comprandom"],"display":"df-rel-comprandom — 相对可计算随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-martingale]]","[[43-df-covers]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§16.5, printed p.506 / PDF p.526; §10.2 Def.10.2.3, printed p.214 / PDF p.234","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-rel-comprandom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-rel-comprandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rel-comprandom — 相对可计算随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§16.5, printed p.506 / PDF p.526; §10.2 Def.10.2.3, printed p.214 / PDF p.234"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}^A\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的有效编码解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Covers}\">\\(\\mathrm{Covers}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b31a1edfb1ee2862\" href=\"?note=b31a1edfb1ee2862\" title=\"43-df-covers\">43-df-covers</a>。有限二进制串、整数、有理数及其有限元组固定使用有效编码。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是全定义有理值函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}^A(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\exists q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\,[\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\,\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,|q(\\sigma,k)-d(\\sigma)|\\le2^{-k}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}^A(d)\\iff\\mathrm{Martingale}(d)\\land\\exists q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\,[\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\,\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,|q(\\sigma,k)-d(\\sigma)|\\le2^{-k}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A(X)\\iff\\forall d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,[\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}^A(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}^A(X)\\iff\\forall d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\,[\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}^A(d)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Covers}(d,X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将可计算资本函数的双侧有理近似整体相对化；成功仍指资本无界。书§16.5使用有理值鞅，其与这里实值有效Cauchy接口等价；本原子采用与本书目录现有实值定义相容的版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-covers","status":"resolved","id":"b31a1edfb1ee2862","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnch